## 9. Observability

- Nest `Logger` per class (matching existing modules); Sentry captures
  unhandled errors via the already-installed interceptor/instrumentation.
- Log key events at appropriate levels: index bootstrap/settings convergence,
  reindex start/finish with counts (like the reconciliation log line in
  file-processor), indexing job failures, Meili-unavailable in health.

