## 10. Shared utilities promotion (decision)

Move three items out of `src/features/file-processor` into `src/common` and
update file-processor's imports (small, mechanical refactor):

- `Principal` + `SYSTEM_PRINCIPAL`  → `src/common/principal.ts`
  (generalized from `FilePrincipal`; `file.types.ts` re-exports or aliases for
  back-compat).
- `CurrentUser` decorator → `src/common/decorators/current-user.decorator.ts`.
- `ZodValidationPipe` → `src/common/pipes/zod-validation.pipe.ts`.

Both features then share one implementation. This is the only change to
file-processor this session and touches no file-processing logic.

